 {{Illucraft|name=Shadow Demon Disruption}}

* Applies the following ability effects on the affected hero:
** {{Symbol|Disruption}} Upon cast:
*** Checks the affected hero's {{M|current health}} values.
*** {{M|Hidden}}
*** {{M|Invulnerable}}
** {{Symbol|Illusions}}
*** Creates [[illusions]] at the end of the hidden duration, with the following properties:
**** Follows the affected hero's {{M|facing angle}}.
**** Only the illusion's health value corresponds to the previous checked health value, other illusion stats are determined upon the illusion creation.
**** The illusion bounty is defined as:
***** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|{{G|illusion bounty level factor}} × [[Illusion#Bounty|Illusion]]<sub>LVL</sub>}}
*** {{Symbol|fx|v}}
**** The created illusions carry Shadow Demon's name.
*** The affected hero always reappears between the illusions, at the right vertex of an isosceles [[wikipedia:Right triangle|right triangle]]
**** {{Symbol|Illusform|2a}} or {{Symbol|Illusform|2b}} or {{Symbol|Illusform|2c}} or {{Symbol|Illusform|2d}}

* Considers {{M|clones}}, {{M|illusions|x}}, and the {{H|Spirit Bear}} as heroes; other {{M|creep-heroes}} as creeps.
** {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} {{Symbol|Illusions}}
*** Can be cast on illusions, creating illusions based on the original hero.
*** However, it does not create illusions if the affected unit {{M|dies}} while affected by Disruption.

* {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
** {{M|Doubletap}} casts the ability on Shadow Demon.
** {{M|Disable Help}} on Shadow Demon prevents Disruption from affecting the allied hero.
** {{hi|Shadow Demon}} {{Symbol|Disruption}}
*** The following abilities and its effects, regardless of its source, fully affects the affected hero under the most recent Disruption cast by Shadow Demon:
** {{A|Shadow Demon|Disseminate}}
** {{A|Shadow Demon|Shadow Poison}} and {{A|Shadow Demon|Shadow Poison Release}}.
** {{A|Shadow Demon|Demonic Cleanse}}
** {{A|Shadow Demon|Demonic Purge}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Disruption icon0}}
| desc = Banishes the targeted unit from the battlefield for a short duration.  Upon returning, two illusions of the banished unit with bonus base damage are created under Shadow Demon's control.
}}
* {{Symbol|fx|v}}
** {{Symbol|Invisible}}
*** When the affected hero becomes [[invisible]] during Disruption, the ability effects turn invisible as well.

* The created [[illusion]] has the following distances apart to the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} target unit correspondingly to the targeted unit's {{M|collision size}}:
{{Colsizecard}}

* {{cf|talnotes}} Acquiring the {{ValueColor||charges|25tal}} {{M|talent|t=t4l}} immediately grants {{ValueColor||1|25tal}} extra charge.

