 * {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|shadow_demon_purge_slow}}
** All ability effects is bound to the debuff, and are applied as follows:
**# The continuous offensive {{M|basic dispel}} and {{Symbol|bonus agh}} {{M|Break}} for the entire duration.
**# The values change per {{M|server tick}} over the entire debuff duration, over {{#expr:{{#var:Demonic Purge value5}}/{{G|tick rate}}}} instances:
**#* {{Symbol|a|up}}
**#** The {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} reaches its max value at the end of the duration, and is defined as:
**#*** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|Σ[[Spell Damage|SpellDmg]] {{=}} 0 + MAXValue / Duration × f([[Server Tick|ServerTick]])}}
**#** Increases by {{calc|v1/{{#var:Demonic Purge value5}} round2|v1={{#var:Demonic Purge value2}}}} damage per second, reaching max values at the end of the duration.
**#* {{Symbol|a|down}}
**#** The {{M|movement speed}} slow is applied inversely at max power, then reduces per instance, and is defined as:
**#*** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|Current[[Movement Speed|MS]]Slow {{=}} (MAXValue - MINValue) / Duration × f([[Server Tick|ServerTick]])}}
**#** The affected enemy unit regains {{#expr:{{#explode:({{#var:Demonic Purge value4}}|%}}-{{#explode:{{#var:Demonic Purge value3}}|%}})/{{#var:Demonic Purge value5}} round2}}% movement speed per second.
**# The {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} accumulated upon losing the debuff in any way.
** Hence, recasting the ability on the same enemy unit dispels the buff, applies the spell damage, then reapplies another debuff instance.

* {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
** Affects the following enemy units:
*** {{M|Couriers}}
** Does not affect the following enemy units:
*** Already {{M|invulnerable}} units, applies all ability effects if the invulnerability source can be dispelled.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Demonic Purge icon0}}
| desc = Purges the target enemy unit, removing positive buffs, and slowing the target for the duration.  The unit slowly regains its speed until the end of the duration, upon which damage is dealt.  Units under the effect of Disruption can still be affected by Demonic Purge.
}}
